    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horror Manor</h2>Step into the decaying halls of Horror Manor, an abandoned estate shrouded in mystery. Curiosity lures you deeper into its corridors, but the manor has other plans. With a sudden click, the doors slam shut, trapping you within its chilling embrace.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Face the Spirits</h2>Explore the Manor: Navigate through decaying rooms, dusty libraries, and hidden passages, each holding a piece of the manor's tragic past.<br>Uncover the Secrets: Decipher cryptic clues, solve intricate puzzles, and piece together the manor's horrifying history.<br>Confront the Shadows: Encounter terrifying entities that lurk within the manor's darkness, their whispers echoing through the halls.<br>Can you escape the clutches of Horror Manor?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Immersive Atmosphere:</strong> Experience the chilling dread of Horror Manor with haunting soundscapes and a terrifyingly realistic environment.<br></li><li><strong>Suspenseful Exploration:</strong> Uncover hidden secrets and solve puzzles as you navigate the manor.<br></li><li><strong>Terrifying Encounters:</strong> Face the horrifying entity lurking in the shadows.<br></li><li><strong>Desperate Escape:</strong> Find a way out of the manor before it consumes you.</li></ul><br><strong>Are you brave enough to enter the Manor?</strong>",
